      "id": 26205,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-02-27T21:49:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Spiff&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Spiff\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Really, the thing you have to say about playing the expansion is that the cards were high quality?  That’s it? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Well, it’s not like he hadn’t played with the cards before - he just hadn’t played with them printed on the actual cards with the artwork. So… Yeah. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Mind you, I’m still jealous. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Rabit</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:00:08.199Z",
